  "wikitext": "{{Short description|Species of grass}}\n{{Speciesbox\n|genus = Festuca\n|species = elegans\n|authority = [[Boiss.]]\n|synonyms = \n* Festuca elegans subsp. merinoi <small>(Pau) Fuente & Ortúñez </small>\n* Festuca merinoi <small>Pau</small>\n|synonyms_ref =  <ref name=\"kew\"/>\n}}\n\n'''''Festuca elegans''''' is a species of grass in the family [[Poaceae]]. This species is native to Morocco, Portugal, and Spain. Is perennial and prefers temperate biomes. ''Festuca elegans'' was first described in 1838.<ref name=\"kew\">{{cite web |title=''Festuca elegans'' Boiss. |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:402697-1#synonyms |access-date=2023-01-14}}</ref>\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Taxonbar|from=Q5861398}}\n\n[[Category:Festuca|elegans]]\n\n\n{{Festuca-stub}}",
